{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/65dedf0328e012b58c92212e4b2cdce5.avif?t=1759772893\" width=616 height=133 /></span>Take to the skies on a mighty dragon and unleash fiery attacks on your enemies. Explore a vast enchanted realm and save the people of Azarkeen. Unleash deadly abilities and magical powers to prevent a corrupt holy war spreading across the world. Restore the balance in spectacular third-person action in solo or multiplayer modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.poster.avif?t=1759772893\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.webm?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/19abe1a26dc0a334adc21e9eb9051db5.mp4?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge an unbreakable bond with your dragon and prepare for high-speed chases, intense duels, and blazing showdowns as you work to avenge and rekindle the Boundless Order.  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/1d47c41772fae20394ef72abe168e042.avif?t=1759772893\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.poster.avif?t=1759772893\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.webm?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/5bbbfe4ddd9e51b33028cdc5d4a5cc19.mp4?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in exhilarating battles against world class bosses, both atop dragons and on foot.  Solo or with a band of dragon-riders, you must utilize strategy and cunning to defeat these powerful beasts.   <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f30965f30b815cc22f029990ec49babe.avif?t=1759772893\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.poster.avif?t=1759772893\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.webm?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/09e290032195e9adc17600a9bc98dece.mp4?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and ancient artifacts to rebuild Dragonhold and the nearby castle town. Unlock new powers and features as you complete expeditions in the besieged Azarkeen region of Aval. As you rebuild parts of the castle, you will rekindle the cosmic energies of the Boundless order and gain new abilities. Craft weapons, armor, and magical items to aid you in your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/f9f6f25ae6d935ade682bb90dbd55f99.avif?t=1759772893\" width=616 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.poster.avif?t=1759772893\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.webm?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/214d5ad1726bc2c92f6db82499eede44.mp4?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Are you ready to become a member of the legendary Boundless Order, harnessing the power of dragons and etching your name into the annals of history? Your destiny awaits in Dragonhold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.poster.avif?t=1759772893\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.webm?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/extras/cae818851c4cc5805e9cb36411deaa27.mp4?t=1759772893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1510330?t=1759772893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1510330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759772893